# api-live-catalog

**Outdated (2026-10-23):** access for this delivery is `MANUAL` only. Public catalog reads do not use that limit.

Categories are an unlimited tree with Bangla and English titles. A module has both titles, both descriptions, one category, and status draft or published. Access for this delivery is `MANUAL`.

Each change stores a draft. Publish requires a final save. Students receive published modules only. Delete is Master Admin only.

Do not create exams, a roster, or sittings in this stage. Do not write this model into `exam_modules` or `exam_nodes`.
